  "solutionQuery": "SELECT name, COALESCE(bonus, 0) AS bonus_paid FROM Employees ORDER BY name ASC",
  "explanation": "COALESCE returns its first non-NULL argument, so COALESCE(bonus, 0) turns every missing bonus into a numeric 0 while leaving real bonus values untouched. No WHERE clause is used because every employee must be listed, and the final ORDER BY name makes the output deterministic.",
